      "updated_at": "2021-02-09T11:30:58Z",
      "body": "Note that the processor introduced in https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/68415 is suitable for the use case of content fingerprinting. Despite having \"fingerprint\" in this issue title, the issue description describes the content anonymization use case which is different as explained in the [comment above](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/53578#issuecomment-599540514). The fingerprint processor is not intended for content anonymization. The work on a processor intended for that use case is tracked in #34085.",
